WEBVTT

00:00:00.025 --> 00:00:08.827
A public Hugging Face checkpoint can usually be downloaded directly without requesting special model access.

00:00:08.827 --> 00:00:15.802
For example, q w e n three zero point six billion is available as a public checkpoint.

00:00:15.802 --> 00:00:24.447
The Transformers code downloads the tokenizer, configuration, and model files into the local Hugging Face cache.

00:00:24.447 --> 00:00:28.826
After that, the actual inference runs on your own hardware.

00:00:29.576 --> 00:00:31.303
This distinction matters.

00:00:31.303 --> 00:00:38.038
Hugging Face may host the files, but Hugging Face is not necessarily running the model for you.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:44.183
Once the weights are downloaded, your C P U or G P U is doing the generation.

00:00:44.183 --> 00:00:52.439
For a normal public checkpoint, you usually do not need a Hugging Face access token just to download the public files.
